    "name": "Field",
    "owner": null,
    "crate": "tracing-core",
    "version": "0.1.36",
    "kind": "struct",
    "signature": "struct Field",
    "docs": "An opaque key allowing _O_(1) access to a field in a `Span`'s key-value\ndata.\n\nAs keys are defined by the _metadata_ of a span, rather than by an\nindividual instance of a span, a key may be used to access the same field\nacross all instances of a given span with the same metadata. Thus, when a\nsubscriber observes a new span, it need only access a field by name _once_,\nand use the key for that name for all other accesses.",
